<view class="page"><view class="panel"><text class="title">7日经营模拟</text><text class="sub">第 {{day}} / 7 天｜每天结束后生成广告、订单、库存和现金结果。</text><view wx:if="{{snapshot}}" class="snapshot"><text>今日曝光：{{snapshot.impressions}}</text><text>今日点击：{{snapshot.clicks}}</text><text>今日订单：{{snapshot.orders}}</text><text>今日销售额：${{snapshot.sales}}</text><text>今日广告花费：${{snapshot.adSpend}}</text><text>剩余库存：{{snapshot.inventory}}</text><text>现金余额：¥{{snapshot.cash}}</text><text wx:if="{{snapshot.stockout}}" class="warn">今日发生断货，部分订单未成交</text></view><button wx:if="{{!done}}" bindtap="onNextDay">结束今天 ▶</button><button bindtap="onBack">返回广告页</button></view></view>